  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jahizun: Community Resilience and DRR in Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program is divided into two phases, the initial phase is focussed on capacity building of partner organisations while the second phase is focussed on community assessment and implementation of activities prioritised as the result of the assessment and the learnings from the trainings delivered in phase one. Throughout the second phase a series of knowledge exchanges will take place to ensure to facilitate learnings and best practices for sustainability and scalability.</narrative>
  </description>
